@startuml
title Send Message Sequence Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Sender" as Sender
participant "Angular Messages Page" as SenderApp
participant "Security Filter" as Security
participant "MessageController" as MessageController
participant "MessageService" as MessageService
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepository
participant "MessageRepository" as MessageRepository
participant "NotificationService" as NotificationService
database "MySQL" as MySQL
actor "Recipient" as Recipient
participant "Angular Messages/Notifications Page" as RecipientApp

Sender -> SenderApp: Write message
Sender -> SenderApp: Click send
SenderApp -> Security: POST /messages
Security -> Security: Validate Bearer JWT

alt Token invalid or expired
  Security --> SenderApp: 401 Unauthorized
  SenderApp --> Sender: Redirect to login
else Token valid
  Security -> MessageController: Authenticated send message request
  MessageController -> MessageService: sendMessage(request, currentUser)
  MessageService -> UserRepository: find recipient
  UserRepository -> MySQL: Query users
  MySQL --> UserRepository: Recipient or empty

  alt Recipient missing or same as sender
    MessageService --> MessageController: validation/business error
    MessageController --> SenderApp: 400/404 Error
    SenderApp --> Sender: Show send error
  else Recipient valid
    MessageService -> MessageRepository: save(message)
    MessageRepository -> MySQL: Insert messages row
    MySQL --> MessageRepository: Message saved
    MessageService -> NotificationService: Create message notification
    NotificationService -> MySQL: Insert notifications row
    MessageService --> MessageController: Message response
    MessageController --> SenderApp: 201 Created
    SenderApp --> Sender: Show message as sent
  end
end

Recipient -> RecipientApp: Open conversation or notifications
RecipientApp -> Security: GET /messages/conversations/{senderId}
Security -> MessageController: Authenticated conversation request
MessageController -> MessageService: getConversation(currentUser, sender)
MessageService -> MessageRepository: Load messages
MessageRepository -> MySQL: Query messages by sender/recipient pair
MySQL --> MessageRepository: Conversation messages
MessageService --> MessageController: Conversation response
MessageController --> RecipientApp: 200 OK
RecipientApp --> Recipient: Display message

@enduml
